        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Thai.ID does not collect any personal data from your documents. If you delete the Thai.ID application, all of your uploaded documents will also be deleted.\n\nIf Thai.ID offers additional services that involve personal data storage in the future, we will notify you later."
